<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the world fencing championships on Thursday:</p>
<p>Women's epee semifinals</p>
<p>Zuleidys Ortiz-Puente (Cuba) beat Taimi Chappe (Spain) 15-7</p>
<p>Miraida Garcia-Soto (Cuba) beat Gyongyi Szalay (Hungary) 15-7</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Garcia-Soto beat Ortiz-Puente 15-12</p>
<p>Men's team epee semifinals</p>
<p>Germany beat Italy 40-38</p>
<p>Cuba beat France 45-41</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Cuba beat Germany 45-34</p>
</text>
